The '''Emerald Archon Shard''' is an [[Archon Shard]] that adds one of these effects:
* {{D|Toxin}} Status Effects deal more damage
* [[Healing|Recover Health]] each time enemies are damaged by a {{D|Toxin}} Status Effect 
* Gain [[Ability Damage]] bonus on enemies affected by {{D|Corrosion}} Status ({{D|Corrosive}})
* Increase max stacks of {{D|Corrosion}} Status

'''Tauforged Emerald Archon Shards''' are a rarer variant of the Emerald Archon Shard that provide a larger bonus to the same stats.

==Acquisition==
See [[Archon Shard#Fusion]] for more details:
*Combining {{Resource|Amber Archon Shard|Amber}} and {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard|Azure}} creates an {{Resource|Emerald Archon Shard}}.
**Combining {{Resource|Tauforged Amber Archon Shard|Tauforged Amber}} and {{Resource|Tauforged Azure Archon Shard|Tauforged Azure}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Emerald Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Emerald Archon Shard|Emeralds}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Emerald Archon Shard}}.

