==Tips and Interactions==
{{Stub}}
=== Toxin Status Effects deal additional damage ===

=== Recover Health each time enemies are damaged by a Toxin Status Effect ===

* Effect caps out at '''10''' stacks, or '''20''' health per second ('''30''' for Tauforged shards), per affected enemy.

* Any companion can proc the effect if modded for toxin. Duplex bond clones can also trigger it.

=== Ability Damage bonus on enemies affected by Corrosion Status (Corrosive) ===

=== Increase max stacks of Corrosion Status ===
*Does not increase the stack limit for bosses that cap status stacks at 4.

